{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "輔行敘：佛昔作王，名尸毗，天變鴿以試。按薩婆達即尸毗。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兩澤相麗，互相滋益。朋友\n講習，其象如此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "什疑釋存考"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "簡，閱也。人有善，簡閱於天心也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "皆文王子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "衣服，常服。黻，蔽膝也，\n以韋為之。冕，冠也。智，祭服也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "黃帝曰雲門，又曰咸池；堯曰大章，存以備考。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四禪共十，\n重出者不論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
